Files included (unmodified from the upstream repository):
  - mobile_sam_image_encoder.onnx
  - sam_mask_decoder_single.onnx

Changes made:
  - No modification was made to the file contents. Only the ONNX weight files (not the
    Python export scripts also published in that repository) actually loaded by this
    application were selected and copied verbatim into public/models/mobile-sam/ so
    that smart-object-select can serve the model from its own origin instead of
    fetching it from the Hugging Face Hub at runtime.

